 Bars","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Pop-Up Restaurants","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Salad","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer Bar, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","review_id":"QUNACCtk_4VdFk-koRybeQ","date":"2019-06-20T15:27:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448167085647583,"text_excerpt":"Definitely a dope spot to see great views of the city. It's inside an unassuming hotel so it can easily be overlooked by tourists. Super trendy inside and the patio outside is big enough but during peak hours it may become an issue. I went on a Friday around 5:30 and by the time we left there was a line to get upstairs. I ordered the same cocktail twice and one was delicious and one tasted like cough medicine. Service was good though. Pro tip- take the street car there instead of an Uber."},{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","review_id":"1nC8DVO1mZA7kzlID3ex3w","date":"2016-10-04T14:03:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387012124061584,"text_excerpt":"Wow! That view! I love rooftop bars....especially overlooking our wonderful city on a mild summer/ early fall evening! Hot Tin is located on the top of the Pontchartrain Hotel on St Charles Avenue so their are great views of downtown New Orleans (as you can see from all of the pictures!). Since it is a rooftop bar, you have to take the elevators up to the top. Unfortunately there are 2 tiny elevators and Hot Tin is very very popular. That results in a wait if you come on a weekend, which I've heard can be 10-30 minutes. Luckily for us, we visited Hot Tin on a Thursday at around 9 and we were able to get right in the elevator and go up to the roof! You go to Hot Tin for the view! The drink..."},{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","review_id":"BDBWT8K4ikVEc2AXuqGTIg","date":"2020-02-15T17:00:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9370529651641846,"text_excerpt":"Loved the view at Hot Tin! My friends and I stopped by before our flight to relax and kill some time. The hotel that Hot Tin is in is super cute and well decorated, even the elevator up to Hot Tin was super cute haha. It was hard to find a spot to sit since it's not too big and it was a little too chilly to sit outside, but when you do sit down, you have the chance to look at all the cute decor all around. I didn't order a drink, but the drink menu looked really good! I also absolutely loved the view of the city from the rooftop! It's a great way to see the entire city and get a sense of the great character of New Orleans."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","photo_id":"CEGz4Sypjg87UqdlZlWIGg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CEGz4Sypjg87UqdlZlWIGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8964627981185913},{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","photo_id":"0s50NFg5liVzuBFI93e1NQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0s50NFg5liVzuBFI93e1NQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8861538767814636},{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","photo_id":"FvpKjcMCL6O8dWdN72zgeA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FvpKjcMCL6O8dWdN72zgeA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8657702207565308},{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","photo_id":"CG9wN4A0AEhPPTpFDDmuew","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/CG9wN4A0AEhPPTpFDDmuew.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8118176460266113},{"business_id":"EHhwVLuIIrq4somySU0m8A","photo_id":"Jw6iexz42dP16bg0fNdziA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Jw6iexz42dP16bg0fNdziA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7298634052276611}]},"notebook_case":null}
